      <h1 class="font-luxury text-white mb-2" data-aos="fade-down">Interior Designer Vashi</h1>
      <div class="custom-breadcrumb text-center justify-content-center d-flex gap-2">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="text-muted">/</span>
        <span>Vashi Branch</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Rich Localized SEO Content Section -->
  <section class="py-5 bg-dark text-white">
    <div class="container py-5">
      <div class="row g-5">
        <!-- Main Content Column -->
        <div class="col-lg-8" data-aos="fade-right">
          <h2 class="font-luxury text-gold h3 mb-4">Transforming Residences and Corporate Spaces in Vashi</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">Are you looking for a professional, top-tier <strong>Interior Designer Vashi</strong> to design your dream space? Siddhivinayak Designers is Navi Mumbai's leading luxury interior design and turnkey civil contracting agency. Vashi is Navi Mumbai's commercial hub, featuring premium row houses and legacy residential towers. We specialize in converting legacy apartments and premium corporate offices into masterpieces.</p>
          <p class="text-muted">Our turnkey interior contracting services cover structural alterations, electrical wiring modifications, tiling masonry, ceiling design, modular kitchen installations, and customized wooden furniture design. We manage local permissions and coordinate with building committees to ensure clean and punctual execution.</p>
          
          <div class="my-5 p-4 bg-dark-card border border-warning">
            <h4 class="font-luxury text-white mb-3">Key Landmark Societies We Serve in Vashi:</h4>
            <ul class="row list-unstyled text-muted small">
              <li class="col-md-6 mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-gold me-2"></i> Kesar Solitaire Sector 19</li>
<li class="col-md-6 mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-gold me-2"></i> Neelkanth Kingdom Sector 11</li>
<li class="col-md-6 mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-gold me-2"></i> Maruti Paradise Sector 15</li>
<li class="col-md-6 mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-gold me-2"></i> Vashi CIDCO Row Houses Sector 2</li>
</ul>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-3">We also cater to sites situated near prominent local spots such as <strong>Sagar Vihar Vashi, Mini Seashore Vashi, Vashi Plaza market, and CIDCO Exhibition Center</strong>.</p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Bespoke Turnkey Interior Contracting</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Unlike typical freelance decorators who only offer layouts on paper and leave you to manage unverified local contractors, Siddhivinayak Designers operates as a single-window turnkey contractor. This means we take absolute responsibility for everything. Our in-house team handles wall breaking, brick masonry, water supply piping changes, paint putty layers, and customized modular furniture installation.</p>

          <!-- Portfolio Image 1 -->
          <div class="my-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/2026-04-11 (19).webp" class="img-fluid w-100 border border-secondary" alt="Luxury Living Room Interior Design Vashi" style="border-radius:4px; max-height:400px; object-fit:cover;" />
            <p class="small text-muted text-center mt-2">Recent luxury interior execution in Vashi by our contracting team.</p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Civil Work, Structural Demolition &amp; CIDCO Safety Clearances</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Vashi's older buildings require careful planning for civil modifications and load redistribution. We obtain structural clearances, provide stability reviews, and apply advanced waterproofing systems in wet zones using CPVC lines to eliminate leakage risks permanently.</p>
          <p class="text-muted">Our civil execution services include advanced waterproofing (crucial for flats facing Navi Mumbai's heavy monsoon winds and humidity). We utilize a multi-layered waterproofing system using Dr. Fixit chemical solutions for kitchen zones, bathroom floors, and balconies. We replace outdated pipes with high-durability CPVC lines to eliminate leakage risks permanently.</p>

          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Custom Modular Kitchens &amp; Space Saving Wardrobes</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">We customize modular kitchen layouts using CenturyPly BWR marine plywood and scratch-resistant acrylic laminates. Our modular layouts utilize Hettich hydraulic hinges and soft-close drawer runners to prevent moisture warping.</p>

          <!-- Portfolio Image 2 -->
          <div class="my-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/2026-04-11 (20).webp" class="img-fluid w-100 border border-secondary" alt="Bespoke bedroom interior and wardrobe layout Vashi" style="border-radius:4px; max-height:400px; object-fit:cover;" />
            <p class="small text-muted text-center mt-2">Custom carpentry fabrication and ambient bedroom layouts.</p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Material Selection &amp; Brand Spec Sheets</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Our renovations in Vashi use heavy-duty, certified materials designed to reinforce older structural frameworks. Below is the specification sheet we recommend for local residential projects:</p>
          <ul>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>Structural Plywood:</strong> CenturyPly (Sainik / Club Prime) or Greenply IS:710 certified BWP Marine Plywood. We never use MDF or particle board for structural framing.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>Modular Shutters:</strong> Premium 1.2mm anti-scratch acrylic finishes or Royale Touche natural wood veneers.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>Hardware &amp; Channels:</strong> Hettich (Sensys soft-close hinges) or Blum (motorized drawer runner slides) carrying lifetime warranties.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>Waterproofing Coatings:</strong> Dr. Fixit 301 LW+ structural admixture and Super Latex waterproofing seals.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>Wall Finishing System:</strong> Asian Paints Royale Luxury Emulsion or Dulux Velvet Touch paints over double-coat acrylic wall putty.</li>
          </ul>

          <!-- Portfolio Image 3 -->
          <div class="my-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/2026-04-11 (21).webp" class="img-fluid w-100 border border-secondary" alt="Commercial office space interior designer Vashi" style="border-radius:4px; max-height:400px; object-fit:cover;" />
            <p class="small text-muted text-center mt-2">Premium commercial office and retail interiors near Vashi station.</p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">False Ceiling Designs &amp; Lighting Layouts</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">We install gypsum ceilings with indirect LED cove lighting and adjustable spotlights, providing glare-free task lighting and a modern aesthetic.</p>
          <p class="text-muted">These track lighting systems allow you to slide, rotate, or exchange spotlight panels according to your furniture layout shifts, giving you total flexibility. We integrate automated dimming controllers to let you switch between bright functional light and cozy warm ambient settings with a click.</p>
          
          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Why Choose Us as Your Local Vashi Designers</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">We are Vashi's trusted design-contracting agency because of our structural civil expertise, transparent pricing, and design accuracy. We provide detailed BOQs and a 10-year warranty, using only genuine materials.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Form Column -->
        <div class="col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-left">
          <div class="p-4 bg-dark-card border border-light-subtle rounded-0 sticky-top" style="top: 100px;">
            <h4 class="font-luxury text-white mb-3 text-center">Inquire For Vashi</h4>
            <p class="small text-muted text-center">Book a complimentary site measurement and consultation visit.</p>
            <form class="luxury-form" id="contactForm">
              <input name="location" type="hidden" value="Vashi" />
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="cName">Full Name</label>
                <input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="cName" name="name" required="" type="text" />
              </div>
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="cPhone">Phone Number</label>
                <input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="cPhone" name="phone" required="" type="tel" />
              </div>
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="cEmail">Email Address</label>
                <input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="cEmail" name="email" required="" type="email" />
              </div>
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="cProp">Property Type</label>
                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="cProp" name="property" required="">
                  <option value="1bhk">1 BHK Flat</option>
                  <option selected="" value="2bhk">2 BHK Flat</option>
                  <option value="3bhk">3 BHK Flat</option>
                  <option value="villa">Bungalow</option>
                  <option value="commercial">Office Suite</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="cBudget">Approx. Budget</label>
                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="cBudget" name="budget" required="">
                  <option value="3L-5L">₹3 Lakhs - ₹5 Lakhs</option>
                  <option selected="" value="5L-10L">₹5 Lakhs - ₹10 Lakhs</option>
                  <option value="10L+">₹10 Lakhs +</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="cMsg">Brief Notes</label>
                <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="cMsg" name="message" required="" rows="3"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="d-grid">
                <button class="btn btn-gold btn-sm py-2" type="submit">Request Site Visit</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
      <div class="row mt-5 pt-5 border-top border-secondary">
        <div class="col-12 text-center mb-5">
          <span class="section-subtitle">Local Feedback</span>
          <h3 class="font-luxury text-white h2">Client Reviews in Vashi</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="premium-card p-4">
              <div class="text-gold mb-3"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
              <p class="small text-muted italic">"We hired them for our 3BHK flat on Palm Beach Road. The layout configuration, lighting planning, and structural changes were completed on time. The veneer work is flawless."</p>
              <h6 class="text-white font-luxury mb-1 mt-3">Vikram Patil</h6>
              <small class="text-gold">Palm Beach Road Resident</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="premium-card p-4">
              <div class="text-gold mb-3"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
              <p class="small text-muted italic">"Excellent modular kitchen design and execution in Sector 19. The soft-close runner drawers, quartz stone top, and sliding cabinets are top-notch. Highly recommended."</p>
              <h6 class="text-white font-luxury mb-1 mt-3">Sunita Sharma</h6>
              <small class="text-gold">Sector 19 Resident</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  

